              "tableData": "<table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody><tr><td><b>Action</b></td>\r\n<td><b>Voice Command</b><i> (examples in italics)</i></td>\r\n</tr><tr><td><p>Play announcements through Badge speaker when headset is plugged in.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td><p>Turn announce through speaker on.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr><tr><td><p>Play announcements through headset when headset is plugged in.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td><p>Turn announce through speaker off.</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr></tbody></table>\r\n",
